    N_('A monument of the Assyrian king Shalmaneser III recording his campaigns, including the battle of Qarqar in 853 BC against a coalition of western kings. Among the allies it lists \'Ahab the Israelite,\' credited with two thousand chariots: the earliest Assyrian mention of a named king of Israel, who reigns through much of First Kings.'),
