    N_('Tower excavated by Kathleen Kenyon, 1952–58'),
    N_('The mound of ancient Jericho (Tell es-Sultan), among the oldest towns on earth. The great stone tower here is Neolithic, millennia older than Joshua. The Bible tells of Jericho\'s walls falling before Israel; the dating of the site\'s destruction layers is much debated, one of the harder places where text and trowel meet.'),
