    N_('The vast mound of Hazor, the largest tel in the land: in the Bible \'the head of all those kingdoms,\' the Canaanite city Joshua is said to have burned. Excavators have found a destroyed Canaanite city beneath a later Israelite one, fortified with a monumental gate of the type the Bible links to Solomon.'),
