    N_('Excavated by the Oriental Institute of Chicago, 1925–39; digs continue'),
    N_('The chambered gate of Megiddo, the fortress city guarding the pass into the Jezreel Valley. Here King Josiah fell facing Pharaoh Necho; and the city\'s hill, Har Megiddo, gives its name to Armageddon, the gathering-place of Revelation\'s final battle.'),
